OL,4,Amore than two years, fuelled by AI
OL,5,Ainvestment
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey says "Britain is
OL,8,Fshowing stand-out resilience", while
OL,9,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham says the
OL,10,Fnumbers bring "hope for the future"
OL,12,FGross domestic product (GDP) is a
OL,13,Fmeasure of all the economic activity of
OL,14,Fcompanies, governments, and people -
OL,15,Fhere's why it's important
