OL,3,ABurnham says climate consensus 'gone'
OL,4,Aand pledges 'new era of British
OL,5,Aleadership' in COP31 speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham, the only G7 leader to attend
OL,8,Fthis year's summit, also said the
OL,9,Fgovernment was committed to its 2050
OL,10,Fnet zero target and announced the
OL,11,Fappointment of a new climate security
OL,12,Fenvoy, Dame Madeleine Alessandri
OL,14,FIt comes after the PM was pressed by
OL,15,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch in Parliament
OL,16,Fon Wednesday about whether the Rosebank
OL,17,Foil field would be allowed to proceed
OL,19,FIn October the government
OL,20,Fcontroversially approved drilling in
OL,21,Fthe Jackdaw gas field in the North Sea
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
