OL,3,ANvidia board reportedly weighs ousting
OL,4,ACEO Jensen Huang after second affair
OL,5,Aallegation
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe board of tech giant Nvidia is
OL,8,Fconsidering whether to oust its CEO
OL,9,FJensen Huang, the BBC's US partner CBS
OL,10,FNews and other US media report
OL,12,FStocks in the firm plummeted again
OL,13,Fafter the New York Times reported that
OL,14,FHuang had a second affair with an
OL,15,Fexecutive at his own company
OL,17,FOn Sunday, Huang admitted an affair
OL,18,Fwith a woman, reportedly from another
OL,19,Fcompany - she was also allegedly a
OL,20,FChinese spy
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
